==Greek==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[miˈte̞ra]|lang=el}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|el}} {{term|μήτηρ||mother|lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|grk-pro|el}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|el}} {{m|ine-pro|*méh₂tēr}}.

===Noun===
{{el-noun|f|μητέρες|m=πατέρας}}

# [[mother]]
# something that is the greatest of its kind

====Declension====
